// Added for OmonullOS, November 2026: Settings > theme downloads ztOS's
// wallpapers and ringtones (ztos-media.service: pinned upstream commit,
// sha256 checked). The phone's owner (wheel) may start it without a
// password; only start, only this unit.
polkit.addRule(function (action, subject) {
	if (action.id == "org.freedesktop.systemd1.manage-units" &&
	    action.lookup("unit") == "ztos-media.service" &&
	    action.lookup("verb") == "start" &&
	    subject.isInGroup("wheel")) {
		return polkit.Result.YES;
	}
	return polkit.Result.NOT_HANDLED;
});
